FFmpeg master c69aff745431 (2026-10-10), not in release/9.0 after 9.0.2:
https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/c69aff745431c73e546bdad988ec23f74c79979c

EXIF (of JPEG, PNG and WebP pictures; the MJPEG decoder parses it in every
frame of a video): a chain of IFDs that loops back was followed again and
again, a timeout (OSS-Fuzz). The parse stops at an offset already parsed.
fix-exif-2 and -3 apply after this one.

